w_m3nis_1b␀From what TORO and I could see, the KRA. are swarming all over this place, so let's be sharp.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀r_m3conv_1a␀␀Man...I hate bridges.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀t_m3conv_1b␀␀What the hell are you talking about?␀␀␀␀␀␀r_m3conv_1c␀␀They make perfect kill zones, that's what I'm talking about.␀␀␀␀␀␀s_m3conv_1d␀␀We could stealth our way underneath the bridge, but it'll take us longer to get across.  Your call.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀s_m3conv_2a␀␀What is it?␀␀␀␀␀␀␀w_m3conv_2b␀␀Blueprints...looks like the entire port facility.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
t_m3nis_2a␀Those PMCs are outnumbered and on the run.␀␀␀␀␀␀
r_m3nis_2b␀They're headed for that building on the right.  Must be their Command Center.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
s_m3nis_2c␀Yeah.  They'll be lucky if they make it that far. They're getting slaughtered down there.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
w_m3nis_2d␀Let's buy them enough time to get inside.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀s_m3conv_3a␀␀Looks like some of those PMC's made it safely inside the Command Center.␀␀␀␀␀␀r_m3conv_3b␀␀Yeah...and barricaded themselves behind that bloody door.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
r_m3nis_3a␀The KRA are really laying siege to that Command Center.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
t_m3nis_3b␀You gotta wonder how long those Talon guys can hold out?␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
s_m3nis_3c␀If the KRA get inside that building...␀␀␀␀␀␀
w_m3nis_3d␀...it'll be a bloodbath, I know.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
s_m3nis_3e␀And we'll lose our chance of finding out exactly what they're up to.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
w_m3nis_3f␀C'mon, let's hurry up.␀␀␀␀␀␀w_m3conv_4a␀␀Remember, these guys don't know we're fighting on their side so stay out of their field-of-fire.␀␀␀␀␀␀r_m3conv_4b␀␀Roger that.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀t_m3conv_4c␀␀Roger that.␀␀␀8␀␀pm2_m3nis_4a␀Oh, go to hell you...␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
w_m3nis_4b␀Easy.  We're here to help.  De Bruyn sent us.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀pm2_m3nis_4c␀You need to help them.  The KRA breached our defenses...there were...there were too many of them.  They...␀␀␀␀␀␀
w_m3nis_4d␀Where's everyone holed up?␀␀␀␀␀␀pm2_m3nis_4e␀Downstairs.  In the basement.  But...you...you need to hurry...you...you....␀␀␀␀␀␀
w_m3nis_4f␀Let's get downstairs and find the commander of this outfit.␀␀␀␀␀Ä␀␀
t_m3nis_4g␀Jesus Christ!␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
r_m3nis_4h␀Where are they all coming from?␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
t_m3nis_4i␀They're determined, I'll give'em that.␀␀␀␀␀␀
w_m3nis_4j␀Let's clear these guys out.  We need to get downstairs.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
s_m3nis_5a␀LONESTAR! I knew I recognized that name.␀␀␀␀è␀␀
l_m3nis_5b␀SANDMAN.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
w_m3nis_5c␀You know this guy?␀␀␀␀␀␀
s_m3nis_5d␀Yeah.  Name's Tate Rawlins.  Used to work with him.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
s_m3nis_5e␀He was a SEAL...that is, before he was dishonorably discharged.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
l_m3nis_5f␀It was an other than honorable discharge... and that was a long time ago.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
s_m3nis_5g␀And now what?  You're working for the other side?  The highest bidder?␀␀␀␀␀␀
l_m3nis_5h␀Everything is still black and white for you, isn't it?  You know as well as I do, it's not that simple.␀␀␀␀␀¤␀␀
s_m3nis_5i␀Listen, I outta...␀␀␀␀␀␀
w_m3nis_5j␀Your man De Bruyn...he said you broke your contract with the KRA.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
l_m3nis_5k␀That's right.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
w_m3nis_5l␀Why?␀␀␀␀l␀␀
l_m3nis_5m␀I discovered they were trying to acquire a WMD...a chemical weapon of some kind.  When I confronted them about it, they said they wanted to send a message to the West regarding Koratvia-it's future.  I told them, that under those circumstances, me and my men could no longer continue working for them.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
s_m3nis_5n␀You had a crisis of conscience?␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
l_m3nis_5o␀I wouldn't say that exactly.  But I don't work for terrorists.␀␀␀␀␀␀
r_m3nis_5p␀Uh, I hate to break up the party, but uh...␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
w_m3nis_5q␀Right.  We should go...we have a boat waiting.␀␀␀␀␀␀s_m3conv_5a␀␀Take a look.␀␀`␀␀w_m3conv_5b␀␀A training manual...for the KRA.?␀␀␀␀␀à
␀␀s_m3conv_5c␀␀Yep.  Pretty advanced too.  Covers basic cryptography, IED's, ambush techniques. These are more than just idealistic thugs we're dealing with.  From the looks of it, I'd say they've got some ex-special forces on the payroll.␀␀␀␀␀␀w_m3conv_5d␀␀Good to know.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀w_m3conv_6a␀␀This laptop, it's homepage is set to Talon International.  RAVEN?␀␀␀␀␀␀␀r_m3conv_6b␀␀Checking the directory.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀w_m3conv_6c␀␀Anything?␀␀␀␀␀$␀␀r_m3conv_6d␀␀Not much here, it's been wiped clean, but...they must have been in a rush.  I got what looks like employee records...pay receipts.  The names are Dutch, British, French...South African.  From all over.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀w_m3conv_6e␀␀Download it, we'll pass it on to Navy Intelligence when we get the chance.␀␀␀␀d␀␀w_m3extra_01a␀␀Let's keep moving.  If we don't find that PMC Commander we're back to square one.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀r_m3extra_01a␀␀The KRA crawling all over this place.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀l_m3nis_5m_br_1␀␀I discovered they were trying to acquire a WMD...a chemical weapon of some kind.  When I confronted them about it,␀␀␀␀(␀␀l_m3nis_5m_br_2␀␀they said they wanted to send a message to the West regarding Koratvia-it's future.  I told them, that under those circumstances,␀␀␀␀␀à␀␀l_m3nis_5m_br_3␀␀me and my men could no longer continue working for them.␀␀ô␀␀s_m3conv_5c_br_1␀Yep.  Pretty advanced too.  Covers basic cryptography, IED's, ambush techniques. These are more than just␀␀␀␀␀|␀␀s_m3conv_5c_br_2␀idealistic thugs we're dealing with.  From the looks of it, I'd say they've got some ex-special forces on the payroll.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀obj_infiltrate_yard␀␀Infiltrate Yard␀␀␀␀␀␀␀obj_stealth_through_yard␀Avoid Detection In Yard␀␀␀␀␀␀␀obj_investigate_yard␀Investigate Yard␀␀␀␀obj_obtain_map_intel␀Obtain Map␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀obj_meet_PMCs␀␀Meet PMCs␀␀␀␀␀␀␀obj_infiltrate_base_perimeter␀␀Infiltrate Base Perimeter␀␀␀␀␀␀␀obj_obtain_intel␀Obtain Intel␀␀˜␀␀obj_save_PMCs␀␀Save PMCs␀␀␀<
