w_m3nis_1b␀From what TORO and I could see, the KRA. are swarming all over this place, so let's be sharp.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀r_m3conv_1a␀␀Man...I hate bridges.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀t_m3conv_1b␀␀What the hell are you talking about?␀␀␀␀␀␀r_m3conv_1c␀␀They make perfect kill zones, that's what I'm talking about.␀␀␀␀␀␀s_m3conv_1d␀␀We could stealth our way underneath the bridge, but it'll take us longer to get across.  Your call.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀s_m3conv_2a␀␀What is it?␀␀␀␀␀␀␀w_m3conv_2b␀␀Blueprints...looks like the entire port facility.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
